    gmeow:avoidWhen "Avoid treating the generation marker as generated content or inventing the producing model's identity."@x-gmeow-english ;
    gmeow:howToUse "Retain the actual generation occurrence and known invocation; keep output provenance on the real output artifact."@x-gmeow-english ;
    skos:scopeNote "No modality, token total or success criterion is inferred from this general kind."@x-gmeow-english ;
