    gmeow:avoidWhen "Avoid inferring this kind merely because an image artifact exists or because a model advertises multimodal capability."@x-gmeow-english ;
    gmeow:howToUse "Retain the source's modality evidence and classify only the corresponding generation occurrence."@x-gmeow-english ;
