    skos:definition "A Desire for cuddling or close affectionate holding, under the source’s interaction convention."@x-gmeow-english ;
    gmeow:useWhen "Use for an explicitly reported wish for cuddling."@x-gmeow-english ;
    gmeow:avoidWhen "Avoid reading an affectionate mood or generic contact as this demand."@x-gmeow-english ;
    gmeow:howToUse "Keep the wanting agent on intentBearer; record any actual cuddle as a separate answering Event."@x-gmeow-english ;
    skos:scopeNote "The value grants no consent and does not imply that contact occurred."@x-gmeow-english ;
    skos:example "Record the cuddle wish: ex:cuddleWish gmeow:demandKind gmeow:demandKindCuddles ."@x-gmeow-english .

