    gmeow:useWhen "Use when the request specifically concerns resting on a lap."@x-gmeow-english ;
    gmeow:avoidWhen "Avoid inventing a physical body, geographic place or actual seating arrangement."@x-gmeow-english ;
    gmeow:howToUse "Retain the source’s lap meaning on the Desire, including its simulated context when supplied."@x-gmeow-english ;
    skos:scopeNote "A lap request is not a movement event or evidence that a place was reached."@x-gmeow-english ;
    skos:example "Record the lap wish: ex:lapWish gmeow:demandKind gmeow:demandKindLap ."@x-gmeow-english .

