    gmeow:useWhen "Use when the source’s pets wording means requested petting."@x-gmeow-english ;
    gmeow:avoidWhen "Avoid confusing petting with cuddling, animal ownership or an accepted response."@x-gmeow-english ;
    gmeow:howToUse "Classify the actual wanting and preserve the original wording in its source record."@x-gmeow-english ;
    skos:scopeNote "No body, touching mechanism or permission is manufactured by the kind."@x-gmeow-english ;
